WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.680
Introducing the SmartCoby Ultra Slim SS5K, a 5,000 milliamp hour power bank, just 6.83 mm thin,

2
00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:13.600
designed so you can keep using your phone while it's attached.

3
00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:18.880
Thin enough to forget it's there, built strong enough to count on.

4
00:00:21.340 --> 00:00:26.220
We engineered it down to a hundredth of a millimeter, so every material has a purpose.

5
00:00:26.220 --> 00:00:32.780
The casing is stainless steel, keeping it's strength at just 0.3 mm.

6
00:00:33.660 --> 00:00:40.220
The back is glass fiber reinforced plastic. Together they create a solid, seamless feel that's

7
00:00:40.220 --> 00:00:47.100
easy to use while magnetically attached. Inside is a custom battery cell, balancing a compact

8
00:00:47.100 --> 00:00:53.980
size with flame retardant safety. We refined the smallest details and optimised every bit of

9
00:00:53.980 --> 00:01:01.420
internal space. Every design choice led to this ultra slim profile, the result 5,000 milliamp

10
00:01:01.420 --> 00:01:08.780
hours in a body just 6.83 mm thin. Use your phone as usual while it's attached,

11
00:01:08.780 --> 00:01:14.460
even using the screen with both devices stacked. No need to detach it after every use,

12
00:01:14.460 --> 00:01:19.580
just slip it into your bag and go. Your phone habits stay the same, wherever you are.

13
00:01:21.620 --> 00:01:27.780
At the end of the day it also works as a wireless charger, but over time repeated charging

14
00:01:27.780 --> 00:01:31.220
changes a battery's condition in ways you can't see from the outside.

15
00:01:31.940 --> 00:01:36.820
That's why the SS5K is designed to monitor its condition throughout its lifespan.

16
00:01:38.100 --> 00:01:45.060
With CIO's own NovaCore C3 safety system you can check battery status in a dedicated app.

17
00:01:45.860 --> 00:01:53.300
Just connect it to your phone over USB-C. See battery health, cycle count and cell temperature.

18
00:01:54.580 --> 00:02:00.820
In visible changes become clear, actionable information. We designed for more than the moment of

19
00:02:00.820 --> 00:02:07.380
use, we designed for the long term. Every day portability, with lasting durability,

20
00:02:08.100 --> 00:02:13.620
a device that fits naturally into your daily life. Thinness redefines usability.

21
00:02:13.620 --> 00:02:18.580
SmartCoby Ultra Slim SS5K
